## Email sent to the submitter to inform that an error occurred when generating the PDF attestation email.
## Parameters:  - {0} Date and time
##              - {1} Submitter name
##              - {2} Submission type
##              - {3} item UUID
##              - {4} Error stacktrace
<html>
  <body>
    <p>Dear ${params[1]},</p>
    <p>We are sorry to announce you that an error occurred while generating your ${params[2]} submission PDF attestation.</p>
    <p>Here are some information that might be useful for our team:</p>
    <h5>item UUID</h5>
    ${params[3]}
    <h5>Error description</h5>
    <pre style="border:1px solid #777; background-color:#EEE">${params[4]}</pre>
    <p>Please contact our team for support at ${config.get("mail.helpdesk")}.</p>
  </body>
</html>